By the end of this workshop, participants will be able to:

1. ✅ **Understand LLM fundamentals** - Tokenization, context windows, parameters
2. ✅ **Write production prompts** - Using systematic P.E.N.E. framework
3. ✅ **Build stateful chatbots** - With conversation memory management
4. ✅ **Create agentic systems** - Autonomous tool calling and multi-step reasoning
5. ✅ **Deploy network agents** - Operating mock devices (real-device ready)
6. ✅ **Recognize AI limitations** - When to use AI vs. traditional automation

### Practical Skills Gained

- Build Ansible playbooks 3-5x faster with AI assistance
- Create custom AI agents for network troubleshooting
- Implement agentic workflows for autonomous operations
- Troubleshoot and validate AI-generated outputs
- Migrate from mock to production environments

