#### Common Questions

**Q: Can I use this with OpenAI/GPT-4?**
A: Yes! Tool calling works with both. Just change the API client.

**Q: What about other LLM providers?**
A: Tool calling is becoming standard. Most providers support it.

**Q: How much does this cost in production?**
A: Depends on usage. Estimate: $50-200/month for moderate team use.

**Q: Is this secure?**
A: Add authentication, logging, audit trails, and read-only mode. Never auto-execute risky operations.

**Q: What if the agent makes mistakes?**
A: Always validate critical operations. Use approval workflows for changes.

